      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "connection",
      "stage": "dccp_fsm",
      "description": "For example, DCCP processors MUST NOT reset the connection if some field marked Reserved in this specification is non-zero; if some unknown option is present; or if some feature negotiation option mentions an unknown feature.",
